'''Traffic Violation''' (違反者講習, ''Ihansha Kōshū'', '''Traffic Offender Course''') is a 3-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 14.3 Update|Version 14.3]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

==Effect==
"Resistant" Effect UP (M): The effect of this ability is increased by 20%.

